<title>USA: Reynolds Metals Co Q4 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Reynolds Metals Co Q4 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call mean estimate Q4 $0.25</p>
<p>First Call mean estimate annual $1.79</p>
<p>	     Consolidated Statement of Income (Unaudited)</p>
<p>				 Quarter ended	  Year ended</p>
<p>				  December 31	  December 31</p>
<p>	   (In millions, except per share amounts)</p>
