<p>Average shares outstanding:</p>
<p>Common shares 63,970,000  63,593,000 63,730,000 63,050,000</p>
<p>NOTE: The company reported a net loss of $0.13 per share for the fourth quarter of 1996 after deducting a $9 million dividend on the company's seven percent PRIDES preferred stock.</p>
<p>The results also include a loss on the disposition of certain assets of $5 million, or $0.08 per share.</p>
<p>Revenues declined due to continued softness in ingot and fabricated aluminum product selling prices, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Equities Desk 212 859-1700))</p>
